Package: carsonboot
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Carson <carson@example.invalid>
Depends: efibootmgr, util-linux
Description: Experimental x86_64 UEFI boot manager
 CarsonBoot reads active UEFI firmware boot entries and can chainload EFI
 applications. The package includes an explicit, opt-in installer helper.
 Installing this package does not change the EFI System Partition or firmware
 boot order; the helper requires a separate --apply confirmation.
